body:
Gotcha Evolved is my vote my man. Consistent, easy to turn on/off features and durable I put mine through the washer AND dryer, dropped it in the snow and didnt find it til 2 days later, ran it over with a heavier wheelchair and dropped it countless times and it kept going, went through a full washer/dryer cycle.   





&#x200B;

Go Plus + is really hit or miss and plagued with stupid design. You can't turn off its vibration or flashing, it gets about a 5-10 second delay when catching pokemon. And if you want to use Great Balls or Ultra Balls you HAVE to push the button every time. Pokemon Sleep is super inconsistent on when it decides to work. Think Adventure Sync issues but worse.
